From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BouBou <69978359+BouBouw@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rustic: menu text seam and client screen helpers

A menu text seam: Skin::text, asked by HudBatch::text_styled inside
ui::skin::menu_text() scopes the game opens around the screens it draws as menus
(the title's screens, options, pause, death, stats, the connection and loading
screens, prompts; never the HUD, chat, containers, signs or books), with each
character's advance in the game's font so layouts never move. Client helpers for a
mod that draws the title's lists itself: world_entries(), world_icon(folder),
server_entries() (pings, MOTD, players, icon, LAN worlds), title_select(index) and
press_at(x, y) (a click marked as made up, so the screens' mouse hooks skip it),
the writes queued and run in idle. Rustic ADR 0014, U17.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
diff --git a/crates/horizon-client-render/src/hud.rs b/crates/horizon-client-render/src/hud.rs
